  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    zero_per_row = [sum(1 for c in range(cols) if grid[r][c] == 0) for r in range(rows)]\n    zero_per_col = [sum(1 for r in range(rows) if grid[r][c] == 0) for c in range(cols)]\n    max_row = max(zero_per_row)\n    max_col = max(zero_per_col)\n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 0 and (zero_per_row[r] == max_row or zero_per_col[c] == max_col):\n                result[r][c] = 3\n    return result\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    zero_per_row = [sum(1 for c in range(cols) if grid[r][c] == 0) for r in range(rows)]\n    zero_per_col = [sum(1 for r in range(rows) if grid[r][c] == 0) for c in range(cols)]\n    max_row = max(zero_per_row)\n    max_col = max(zero_per_col)\n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 0 and (zero_per_row[r] == max_row or zero_per_col[c] == max_col):\n                result[r][c] = 3\n    return result",
